        {"id":"follow_scout","text":"以神识锁住风眼，随斥候穿过沙暴（MP 95,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"mp","op":"gte","value":95000},{"stat":"mp_ratio","op":"gte","value":0.60}],"failure_reason":"风眼提前闭合，你的神识被沙暴吞尽","success_text":"众人抢在沙暴合拢前穿过回廊，镇渊关已在前方。"},{"type":"restore_mp","value":-0.16,"if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"true_demon_baohua_contact","if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_TRUE_DEMON_SACRED_002","if_result":["check_success"]}]},
