      "id":"EVT_TRUE_DEMON_SACRED_002","version":1,"title":"镇渊关封锁","body":"镇渊关扼守魔胎祖地，是绯月旧部最后的据点。玄烬的巡天魔舟封死上空，赤霄麾下夺魄兽又从地底攻城；守关玄龟只能勉强托住城墙，你必须先击溃其中一路，才能进入魔胎祖地。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","story_chain","true_demon_sacred_adaptation","manual_only"],"weight":0,
      "choices":[
        {"id":"break_blockade","text":"与守关玄龟合击巡天魔舟（敌方总战力 7,400,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"combat_power","op":"gte","value":7400000}],"failure_reason":"魔舟主炮击穿城墙，将你与玄龟一同轰入地底","success_text":"魔舟阵列崩溃，镇渊关上空出现缺口。"},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"true_demon_island_landed","if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_TRUE_DEMON_SACRED_003","if_result":["check_success"]}]},
        {"id":"borrow_chart","text":"以焚天门图绕过地底禁制","conditions":{"has_item":"true_demon_gate_chart"},"disabled_reason":"你没有下界魔界取得的焚天门图","effects":[{"type":"add_opportunity","value":30},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"true_demon_island_landed"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_TRUE_DEMON_SACRED_003"}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id":"EVT_TRUE_DEMON_SACRED_003","version":1,"title":"双祖夺胎","body":"魔胎祖地中，玄烬圣祖与赤霄天君的化身同时降临。玄烬想吞下魔胎补全魔功，赤霄则要借它重塑第二道身；两人都以法则锚锁住地脉，谁先得手都不会留下镇渊关。绯月牵制双祖化身，你必须毁去锚点。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","story_chain","true_demon_sacred_adaptation","manual_only"],"weight":0,
      "choices":[
        {"id":"break_anchors","text":"在绯月牵制下逐个破坏法则锚（敌方总战力 8,300,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"combat_power","op":"gte","value":8300000}],"failure_reason":"两位圣祖化身同时出手，你被魔光碾为飞灰","success_text":"法则锚尽碎，双祖化身无法继续停留，绯月趁机夺回魔胎。"},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"true_demon_ancestor_blockade_broken","if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_TRUE_DEMON_SACRED_004","if_result":["check_success"]}]},
        {"id":"bargain","text":"向玄烬交出无声魔窟路线，换取一次入池机会","effects":[{"type":"add_karma","value":12},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"true_demon_ancestor_bargain"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_TRUE_DEMON_SACRED_004"}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id":"EVT_TRUE_DEMON_SACRED_004","version":1,"title":"魔胎祖地的造化","body":"双祖化身退去后，绯月打开祖地深处的万劫雷池，并取出一株太初魂芝作为酬谢。雷池炼体、魂芝养神，本可相辅相成；但两种造化同时入体会引发雷火焚魂，只有法体与神识皆足够强横才能兼得。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","story_chain","true_demon_sacred_adaptation","manual_only"],"weight":0,
      "choices":[
        {"id":"pool","text":"进入万劫雷池淬炼法体","effects":[{"type":"damage","value":0.20,"reason":"法体承受不住万劫雷火"},{"type":"add_item","item_id":"cleansed_spirit_mark","if_result":["injured"]},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"true_demon_spirit_cleansed","if_result":["injured"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_TRUE_DEMON_SACRED_005","if_result":["injured"]}]},
