        {"id":"both","text":"引雷火炼体，同时服下太初魂芝","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"hp","op":"gte","value":90000},{"stat":"mp","op":"gte","value":90000}],"failure_reason":"雷火与魂力同时失控，将你的法体与元神一同烧散","success_text":"魂芝护神、雷火炼体，两种造化终于在经脉中完成周天。"},{"type":"damage","value":0.24,"if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"restore_mp","value":-0.22,"if_result":["injured"]},{"type":"add_item","item_id":"cleansed_spirit_mark","if_result":["injured"]},{"type":"add_item","item_id":"purifying_lotus","if_result":["injured"]},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"true_demon_spirit_cleansed","if_result":["injured"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_TRUE_DEMON_SACRED_005","if_result":["injured"]}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id":"EVT_TRUE_DEMON_SACRED_005","version":1,"title":"祖藤根窟","body":"魔胎被移开后，祖地最深处露出一截漆黑根须。绯月终于明白，北域灵脉枯竭并非天灾：蚀天祖藤早已寄生在魔胎上，玄烬正是想借吞噬魔胎把祖藤之力据为己有。根须即将破窟而出，必须趁双祖未返完成封印。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","story_chain","true_demon_sacred_adaptation","manual_only"],"weight":0,
      "choices":[
        {"id":"reseal","text":"斩断根须并重启封根古阵（敌方总战力 9,000,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"combat_power","op":"gte","value":9000000}],"failure_reason":"祖藤根须借你的魔躯破窟而出，黑花妖雨席卷真魔界","success_text":"根须被压回地底，封根古阵重新闭合。"},{"type":"add_item","item_id":"origin_seal_fragment","if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"add_karma","value":-18,"if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"add_fame","value":38,"if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"true_demon_sacred_completed","if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"set_milestone","milestone":"true_demon_origin_seal_restored","if_result":["check_success"]}]},
        {"id":"take_fragment","text":"截取祖藤根晶后撤离（敌方总战力 8,600,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"combat_power","op":"gte","value":8600000}],"failure_reason":"封根傀儡截断退路，你与根晶一同留在古窟中","success_text":"你带走根晶，但祖藤本体仍潜伏在界壁更深处。"},{"type":"add_item","item_id":"origin_seal_fragment","if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"add_karma","value":15,"if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"true_demon_sacred_incomplete","if_result":["check_success"]}]}
      ]
    }
